<div class="wrap guide-body">

  <p class="guide-lede">We deliver locally from {{ site.address.street }} to
  Yonkers, Bronxville, Mt Vernon and Hastings-on-Hudson, generally within
  roughly a seven-mile radius, starting at $15 (as of 2026). Call
  <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a> to arrange
  one, or ask at the counter when you order.</p>

  <h2>What we deliver</h2>

  <p>The things that are heavy, long or awkward enough that a second trip is
  not the answer:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Paint pails</li>
    <li>Sheet-rock</li>
    <li>Lumber</li>
    <li>Bulk bags</li>
  </ul>

  <p>If you are not sure whether something qualifies, ask. It is a short
  conversation and it saves you loading a car badly.</p>

  <h2>Where we deliver</h2>

  <p>Yonkers, Bronxville, Mt Vernon and Hastings-on-Hudson, and most of
  southern Westchester &mdash; generally within about a seven-mile radius of
  the store. Further out than that, ask and we will quote it rather than turn
  it down flat.</p>

  <h2>Curb-side or inside-threshold</h2>

  <p>You can specify where the load lands. Curb-side leaves it at the kerb;
  inside-threshold brings it just inside the door. Say which you want when you
  book, along with anything the driver needs to know &mdash; stairs, a narrow
  drive, a gate code, or where a truck can legally stop on your street.</p>

  <h2>What it costs</h2>

  <p>Delivery starts at $15 (as of 2026). Heavy or pallet loads are quoted
  individually, because the price depends on the weight, the distance and how
  the load has to be handled at your end. Prices are current as of 2026;
  confirm at the counter.</p>

  <h2>Same-day delivery</h2>

  <p>We do offer same-day delivery. Whether it works for a given order depends
  on what you are having moved and what the day looks like, so call
  <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a> and ask
  &mdash; we will tell you straight away whether we can get it to you today.</p>

  <h2>Arranging one</h2>

  <p>The simplest route is to call
  <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a> during store
  hours, or to ask at the counter when you are buying. Have the delivery
  address, a contact number and any access details ready.</p>

